{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14226720","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14226720","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1422672001:1":{"text":"感じます……川とあなたの魂が……血の絆が……再び結ばれました……","source_cn":"我感觉到了……河流和你的灵魂……血脉……重新连接在了一起……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D84F9ED3E6C2B77","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1422672002:0":{"text":"これからは……どこにいても……故郷の水脈は、あなたとつながっていますよ……","source_cn":"从此……无论你前往何处……故乡的水脉都将与你相连……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE628D112AFDF517A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1422672003:1":{"text":"感謝する……うっ……！","source_cn":"多谢——呃！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8770756F832C4D69","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1422672003":{"text":"感謝する……うっ……！","source_cn":"多谢——呃！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8770756F832C4D69","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1422672004:0":{"text":"ああ……まだ少し、痛みが残っているが、もう大丈夫だ。","source_cn":"还好，只是还有点疼的感觉残留，已经没事了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7904CEAF634660EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1422672006:0":{"text":"これで、川の試練は終わったんだろう？次の試練を教えてくれ。","source_cn":"那么，河川的考验已经结束，请告诉我下一项考验是什么吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87CA35404EAA429E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1422672007:0":{"text":"で、ですが……あなたの体は、すごく、弱っています。","source_cn":"你现在的身体状况……很、很糟糕。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E2BD455F186A495","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1422672008:0":{"text":"できれば、暫くは動かずに……休んだ方が……でないと……","source_cn":"最好不要活动……要休息……否则……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3CAC30D5C40E427D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1422672009:0":{"text":"インドラ、それではあなたの体が持ちませんよ！","source_cn":"因度厄，你这样只是在伤害自己的身体！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6BE8AF7C5B794B46","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1422672010:0":{"text":"今の状態では、試練どころか、普通に戦うことすら辛いはずです。","source_cn":"你现在别说接受考验了，就算普通的战斗恐怕也举步维艰！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x28D590D439B4ABD9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1422672011:0":{"text":"ありがとう。気遣ってくれるのは嬉しいが……","source_cn":"谢谢你们。你们的好意我非常明白，只是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC08D640AF3C9BDAD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1422672012:0":{"text":"厄化と比べれば、こんな痛み、どうってことはない。","source_cn":"只是这份痛苦，对于孽化来说，并不算什么。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F30048820ACEB19","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1422672013:0":{"text":"ですが、無理をしては――","source_cn":"你……这样强撑——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x624435297ABC67D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1422672014:0":{"text":"こうしている今も、サロクディアでは多くの人たちが、呪いと厄化の苦しみに苛まれているのだ。","source_cn":"萨洛克兰的许多人，此刻仍然在诅咒与孽化交织的苦痛中沉沦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3B8E1E321C19DCC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1422672015:0":{"text":"ひとりでも多くの仲間を救うために、一秒たりとも無駄にしたくない。","source_cn":"如果我能提前一些，那么就会有越多人得到拯救。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE74C88870B3F3575","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1422672016:0":{"text":"さきほど、イヴォンヌ殿は、故郷の水脈とのつながりが戻ったと言ったな。","source_cn":"刚刚，伊温小姐说，故乡的水脉从此与我相连。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B8904B97EF7462B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1422672017:0":{"text":"あきれるかもしれないが……故郷という言葉を聞いたとき、脳裏に浮かんだのは、やはりサロクディアの光景だった。","source_cn":"但，或许是我不识抬举吧……在提到故乡的时候，我眼前浮现...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD877223502F8275E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1422672018:0":{"text":"サロクディアを救いたい、変えたい……それが、私がここに立っている理由だ。","source_cn":"我想要去拯救它，改变它。这也是我站在此处的理由。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33F026EE0AB4D280","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1422672019:0":{"text":"だから、次の試練を教えてくれ、エルロン。","source_cn":"所以，请告诉我下一项考验是什么吧，埃隆。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1946C2EC5FBCD4BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1422672020:0":{"text":"……本当に、頑固な人ですね。先に忠告しておきますが、次の試練も、きっと一筋縄ではいきませんよ。","source_cn":"……真是固执。我先警告你，接下来的考验并不会更容易。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5BF68A967D752F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1422672021:0":{"text":"それなら、なおさら急がないとな。さあ、行こう。","source_cn":"那就更不能浪费时间了，走吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBBC972EEAD3ADC64","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:4:0:1":{"text":"大丈夫か？","source_cn":"没事吧？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x001F3B5A66AE48B3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"大丈夫か？","female":"大丈夫？","variant_male_record_index":"73456","variant_female_record_index":"73457","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1422672005:0":{"text":"水に浸かっていた時はな。今はだいぶ和らいだ。残った痛みもすぐに消えるだろう。","source_cn":"当时是有些疼，但现在已经好多了，很快就可以恢复正常。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE2B4150A2AC4D22","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:4:1:2":{"text":"痛むのか？","source_cn":"很疼吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC78B0B0B34595814","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"痛むのか？","female":"痛むの？","variant_male_record_index":"73458","variant_female_record_index":"73459","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:伊温":{"text":"イヴォンヌ","source":"伊温","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:因度厄":{"text":"インドラ","source":"因度厄","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:埃隆":{"text":"エルロン","source":"埃隆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":25,"localized_text_count":24,"speaker_count":3}}